<section class="comfort-band" id="comfort" aria-labelledby="comfort-title">
	<div class="comfort-inner">
		<p class="eyebrow">Our one non-negotiable</p>
		<h2 id="comfort-title">Comfort comes before costume.</h2>
		<p>Cats do not need hats to belong. If yours enjoys a costume moment, keep it light, loose, and brief, and stop at the first sign they want it off.</p>
	</div>
</section>

